1
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:17,620
In Dan Simmons' Hyperion, humanity lives across hundreds of worlds.

2
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:21,200
Two things hold them together.

3
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:28,200
The farcasters: portals. Step through a door and you are on another planet.

4
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:38,720
And the fatline: an instant line between the stars, the voice that carries news from world to world.

5
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:42,560
Here's the twist in the book.

6
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:47,200
The farcasters were built by the TechnoCore, the AIs.

7
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:52,560
And they didn't just build the network, they lived inside it.

8
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:58,040
Every time a human stepped through, the core was feeding on them.

9
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:05,340
The network that connected everyone belonged to something that wasn't them.

10
00:01:06,380 --> 00:01:11,020
And when it fell, the worlds were suddenly alone.

11
00:01:12,540 --> 00:01:15,780
Farcaster took its name from that book.

12
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:20,240
And today Farcaster is at a crossroads of its own.

13
00:01:20,240 --> 00:01:22,340
There are different tribes.

14
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:28,440
People who stay with Snapchain.

15
00:01:29,060 --> 00:01:32,540
People who forked and built Hypersnap.

16
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:38,040
Builders who just want open infrastructure that doesn't disappear.

17
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:41,520
People who want coins and markets.

18
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:47,880
And underneath all of it, people who simply want a place to belong.

19
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:51,620
Everyone is asking the same question.

20
00:01:51,820 --> 00:01:54,940
Who keeps the network alive?

21
00:01:55,820 --> 00:01:58,520
Fatline is my answer.

22
00:02:00,260 --> 00:02:02,020
There are 777 beings.

23
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:03,520
The Fatliners.

24
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:07,020
Each one is born from one Farcaster account.

25
00:02:07,980 --> 00:02:08,720
Your history.

26
00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:10,840
How long you have been here.

27
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:12,720
Who you talk to.

28
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:14,000
How you speak.

29
00:02:14,480 --> 00:02:16,060
Becomes its body.

30
00:02:16,820 --> 00:02:18,560
You are your FID.

31
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:23,080
Each Fatliner keeps a node of the network alive.

32
00:02:23,660 --> 00:02:25,800
A full copy of the conversation.

33
00:02:26,600 --> 00:02:29,060
Its own coin pays for that node.

34
00:02:29,500 --> 00:02:30,500
Day by day.

35
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:32,720
Fed, it lives.

36
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:35,400
Left alone, it sleeps.

37
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:37,840
And anyone can wake it.

38
00:02:39,040 --> 00:02:41,920
And this is the part I care about most.

39
00:02:42,740 --> 00:02:45,160
A Fatliner doesn't choose a side.

40
00:02:45,740 --> 00:02:47,400
It can hold Snapchain.

41
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:49,400
It can hold Hypersnap.

42
00:02:49,740 --> 00:02:51,240
It can hold both.

43
00:02:51,660 --> 00:02:56,080
Or any other network of Farcaster in the future.

44
00:02:56,880 --> 00:02:57,820
A blue line.

45
00:02:58,340 --> 00:02:59,460
And a pink line.

46
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:01,180
Side by side.

47
00:03:01,660 --> 00:03:02,500
Never mixed.

48
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:06,180
We always tell you which one you are reading.

49
00:03:06,740 --> 00:03:07,500
You choose.

50
00:03:08,540 --> 00:03:11,720
In the book, the network fed on people.

51
00:03:12,500 --> 00:03:15,040
Here it is the other way around.

52
00:03:15,380 --> 00:03:20,600
The beings come out of the network and they feed it back.

53
00:03:21,140 --> 00:03:23,840
That's the peace we are proposing.

54
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:27,200
Not deciding which chain wins.

55
00:03:27,860 --> 00:03:30,200
More of us keeping copies.

56
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:35,320
Each in our own way.

57
00:03:35,820 --> 00:03:37,040
Each one a thread.

58
00:03:37,660 --> 00:03:38,200
Together.

59
00:03:38,780 --> 00:03:39,320
The weave.

60
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:51,400
If you want one of the 777, open your AI agent and say:

61
00:03:52,100 --> 00:03:56,900
Help me mint one of the 777 Fatlines.

62
00:03:57,740 --> 00:03:59,560
Everything is open source.

63
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:03,340
Come build it with us.
